Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.20,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,the 48 laws of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.40,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,power by robert greene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:03.22,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,in two minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:04.64,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,most people believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:05.52,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,if you just work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:06.64,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,hard and play nice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.52,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,you will rise to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.18,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,the top
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.22,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,in reality
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.74,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,naive people get outmaneuvered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:12.32,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,and crushed every single
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:12.82,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.42,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,power is like gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:15.65,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,you don't have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:16.05,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,like it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:16.86,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,but if you ignore
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.86,0:00:17.49,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,its laws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:18.21,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,you fall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.59,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,take law number one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.89,0:00:21.52,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,never outshine the master
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:23.09,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,nicolas fouquet was a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.77,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,brilliant finance minister who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:25.89,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,wanted to impress king
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:26.88,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,louis the fourteenth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:28.06,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,he threw the most
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:29.44,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,lavish party in history
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:30.86,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,showing off his immense
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:31.36,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,wealth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:33.28,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,instead of being impressed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:34.88,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,the king felt upstaged
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:36.38,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,and terrified of being
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:36.88,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,eclipsed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:38.40,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,within weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:39.82,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,fouquet was thrown into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:40.86,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,a dark dungeon for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:41.50,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,the rest of his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:41.72,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:43.48,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,always make those above
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.09,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,you feel comfortably superior
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:46.77,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,number four
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:48.03,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,always say less than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:48.53,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:50.35,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,the more you speak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:51.40,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,the more ordinary you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:52.35,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,look and the more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:53.49,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,leverage you surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:55.40,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,powerful people speak in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:56.77,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,short ambiguous sentences
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:58.20,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,when you keep your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:00:59.02,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,mouth shut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:00:59.96,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,others rush in to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:00.78,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,fill the silence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:02.54,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,exposing their own weaknesses
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:04.04,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,law number nine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.24,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,win through your actions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:06.30,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,never through argument
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.76,0:01:07.64,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,you cannot win an
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:08.78,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,argument with words
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:09.88,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,even if you are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:11.08,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,right you only breed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:11.58,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,resentment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:13.92,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,demonstrate your value with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:15.69,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,results not endless debate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:17.53,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,law number 48
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:18.73,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,assume formlessness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:20.64,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,rigid people who rely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:21.83,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,on brute force shatter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:22.58,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,when hit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:24.31,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,flexible people who adapt
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.87,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,to changing circumstances are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:27.25,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,impossible to defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:28.69,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,be like water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:29.87,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,you don't study power
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:30.93,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,to become a manipulator
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:32.75,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,you study power so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:33.63,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,you never become a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:34.13,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,victim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:36.03,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,to master all 48
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.79,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,laws grab the complete
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.79,0:01:38.29,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,book
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:39.61,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,the direct link is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:40.49,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,pinned in the top
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:40.99,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,comment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:42.19,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,tell me below
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:43.37,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,would you rather have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:44.81,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,absolute power with zero
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:46.17,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,real friends or true
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:47.78,GoldPhrase100,,0,0,0,,friendship with zero power
